Package: StructuralStats
Title: Tools for Structural Statistical Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Vitaliy", "Lavrukhin", email = "238909@edu.fa.ru", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements statistical methods for structural analysis based on
    Gatev, Kazinets, Salai, and Ryabtsev, along with adaptive time-series
    forecasting and rank-correlation methods discussed in Afanasyev (2019)
    and Persteneva (2012). Includes coefficients of absolute and relative
    structural shifts, the Gini coefficient, Laspeyres/Paasche/Fisher price
    indices, exponential smoothing, and Spearman/Kendall correlation helpers.
